00:16:53,540 --> 00:16:54,700
So starting with game theory.

423
00:16:54,700 --> 00:16:58,900
So standard consumer theory provides the building blocks.

424
00:16:58,900 --> 00:17:01,740
So game theory retains the assumption

425
00:17:01,740 --> 00:17:04,060
that people have utility functions.

426
00:17:04,060 --> 00:17:06,260
Everybody's got a utility function.

427
00:17:06,260 --> 00:17:08,140
Sometimes game theorists talk about payoffs

428
00:17:08,140 --> 00:17:09,340
instead of utility.

429
00:17:09,340 --> 00:17:10,780
It's the same thing.

430
00:17:10,780 --> 00:17:12,100
Exactly the same thing.

