00:17:15,980 --> 00:17:16,500
do you take?

434
00:17:16,500 --> 00:17:17,020
The largest.

435
00:17:17,020 --> 00:17:18,660
Just like if you have a choice of different things

436
00:17:18,660 --> 00:17:21,060
that give you different utilities, which do you do?

437
00:17:21,060 --> 00:17:22,900
I think it gives you the highest utility.

