00:44:07,000 --> 00:44:10,000
then why does anyone believe confessions ever?

78
00:44:10,000 --> 00:44:14,000
If everyone always confesses whether they're innocent or guilty,

79
00:44:14,000 --> 00:44:17,000
why does anybody think that confessions prove anything?

