00:44:58,000 --> 00:45:01,000
But suppose you torture them until they tell you something

91
00:45:01,000 --> 00:45:04,000
they couldn't possibly know unless they were guilty.

92
00:45:04,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Ha ha! All right.

