00:45:19,000 --> 00:45:22,000
and then he told us where the murder weapon was. See?

98
00:45:22,000 --> 00:45:24,000
It was justified.

99
00:45:24,000 --> 00:45:29,000
So this is what a smart person with a very different worldview from our own

100
00:45:29,000 --> 00:45:31,000
had to say about the strategic situation.

101
00:45:31,000 --> 00:45:34,000
I was like, I read it, and I was like, wow, this guy's pretty smart, actually.

