00:45:34,000 --> 00:45:37,000
All right, so at least he's saying something much better

103
00:45:37,000 --> 00:45:40,000
than most modern defenders of torture would say.

104
00:45:40,000 --> 00:45:42,000
It's a winner.

105
00:45:42,000 --> 00:45:44,000
All right, so that's the prisoner's lemma.

106
00:45:44,000 --> 00:45:47,000
It's a classic example of a dominant, solvable game.

107
00:45:47,000 --> 00:45:49,000
Questions?

108
00:45:49,000 --> 00:45:51,000
Happy? Right? Yes?

