01:08:12,440 --> 01:08:13,840
And we're like, yeah, we're here.

235
01:08:13,840 --> 01:08:15,000
All right, so.

236
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:17,760
You're gonna make us think, scientists.

237
01:08:17,760 --> 01:08:20,280
So that's an example where,

238
01:08:20,280 --> 01:08:21,120
well, you can't,

239
01:08:21,120 --> 01:08:23,920
you're like, at the point that Israel's starting,

240
01:08:23,920 --> 01:08:24,760
you're saying, all right,

