271
01:33:20,360 --> 01:33:21,560
Of course, if you always circle around,

272
01:33:21,560 --> 01:33:25,000
then they just figure out what's optimal to do to someone who always circles around.

273
01:33:25,000 --> 01:33:27,520
Right? Now, have you ever played a game called Diplomacy?

