01:33:36,400 --> 01:33:39,320
And therefore, if you are a predictable player,

279
01:33:39,320 --> 01:33:40,480
then you're easy to beat.

280
01:33:40,480 --> 01:33:42,200
So once when my kids were little,

281
01:33:42,200 --> 01:33:43,160
I went and said, tell you what,

282
01:33:43,160 --> 01:33:44,280
you can have five countries,

