01:33:52,320 --> 01:33:56,120
but something to keep in mind when you're teaching kids new games is,

288
01:33:56,120 --> 01:33:58,080
they need to win at least some of the time,

289
01:33:58,080 --> 01:34:01,280
in order for them to realize what a good game it is.

290
01:34:01,280 --> 01:34:03,240
So, the best thing to do.

291
01:34:03,240 --> 01:34:04,840
So, you can either just lose on purpose,

292
01:34:04,840 --> 01:34:07,280
I don't like that, or you can just handicap yourself more.

293
01:34:07,280 --> 01:34:09,480
So, there's that. All right.

294
01:34:09,480 --> 01:34:12,360
Or in another example, so there's the game Rock, Paper, Scissors,

